# MARKETA AI - Design System Rules for Cursor AI

## Overview
This project uses a custom **Notion-inspired Design System** with full RTL support for Arabic. All styles are centralized in `/frontend-user/src/design-system/`.

## Core Principles

### 1. NEVER Write Inline Styles
❌ **DON'T:**
```vue
<button style="padding: 12px; background: #0F7B6C;">Save</button>
```

✅ **DO:**
```vue
<button class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
```

### 2. Use Design System Classes
All styling should use predefined classes from the design system.

### 3. RTL Support is Mandatory
Always consider Arabic (RTL) users. The system automatically handles RTL.

---

## Color System

### Available Colors (100% Notion Colors)
```css
/* Text (Notion Exact) */
--color-text-primary: #37352F     /* Notion's default text */
--color-text-secondary: #787774   /* Muted text */
--color-text-tertiary: #9B9A97    /* Light text */

/* Background (Notion Exact) */
--color-bg-primary: #FFFFFF       /* Main content background */
--color-bg-secondary: #F7F6F3     /* Sidebar & secondary areas */
--color-bg-tertiary: #ECEBE8      /* Tertiary */

/* Brand (Notion Style) */
--color-brand-primary: #0B6E99    /* Blue - Notion's primary action color */
--color-black: #000000            /* Alternative for important actions */

/* Notion Highlight Colors (للنصوص الملونة فقط) */
--color-blue-text: #0B6E99        /* خلفية: #DDEBF1 */
--color-green-text: #0F7B6C       /* خلفية: #DDEDEA */
--color-orange-text: #D9730D      /* خلفية: #FAEBDD */
--color-red-text: #E03E3E         /* خلفية: #FBE4E4 */
--color-purple-text: #6940A5      /* خلفية: #EAE4F2 */
```

### Usage
```vue
<!-- Text colors -->
<p class="text-primary">Main text</p>
<p class="text-secondary">Secondary text</p>
<span class="text-brand">Brand text</span>

<!-- Background colors -->
<div class="bg-primary">White background</div>
<div class="bg-secondary">Light gray background</div>
```

