## Form System

### Input Fields
```vue
<div class="form-group">
  <label class="form-label form-label-required">Email</label>
  <input type="email" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter email">
  <span class="form-hint">We'll never share your email</span>
</div>
```

### Input Sizes
```vue
<input class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="Small">
<input class="form-control" placeholder="Default">
<input class="form-control form-control-lg" placeholder="Large">
```

### Validation States
```vue
<!-- Error State -->
<input class="form-control is-invalid" value="invalid@">
<span class="invalid-feedback">Please enter a valid email</span>

<!-- Success State -->
<input class="form-control is-valid" value="valid@example.com">
<span class="valid-feedback">Looks good!</span>
```

### Checkbox & Radio
```vue
<div class="form-check">
  <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="check1">
  <label class="form-check-label" for="check1">Remember me</label>
</div>

<!-- Switch Toggle -->
<div class="form-check form-switch">
  <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="switch1">
  <label class="form-check-label" for="switch1">Enable notifications</label>
</div>
```

