## Spacing System

### Margin & Padding (4px base)
```vue
<!-- Margin -->
<div class="m-0">No margin</div>
<div class="m-1">4px margin</div>
<div class="m-2">8px margin</div>
<div class="m-3">12px margin</div>
<div class="m-4">16px margin</div>
<div class="m-6">24px margin</div>

<!-- Directional -->
<div class="mt-4">Margin top 16px</div>
<div class="mb-4">Margin bottom 16px</div>
<div class="ml-4">Margin left 16px</div>
<div class="mr-4">Margin right 16px</div>

<!-- Axis -->
<div class="mx-4">Margin horizontal 16px</div>
<div class="my-4">Margin vertical 16px</div>

<!-- Same applies for padding (p-*, pt-*, pb-*, etc.) -->
```

### Gap (for Flexbox/Grid)
```vue
<div class="d-flex gap-2">
  <button>Button 1</button>
  <button>Button 2</button>
</div>

<div class="d-flex gap-4">
  <div>Item 1</div>
  <div>Item 2</div>
</div>
```

