## RTL Support

### Automatic Flipping
The system automatically handles RTL. **Never** write directional styles manually.

❌ **DON'T:**
```css
margin-left: 20px; /* This won't flip in RTL */
```

✅ **DO:**
```vue
<div class="ml-4">Content</div> <!-- Auto-flips to mr-4 in RTL -->
```

### Sidebar Positioning
Sidebars automatically position correctly based on language:
- **English (LTR)**: Sidebar on left
- **Arabic (RTL)**: Sidebar on right

```vue
<!-- This sidebar will auto-position -->
<aside class="dashboard-sidebar">
  <!-- Content -->
</aside>
```

